abstract: >-
  Open companions to papers on parallel hardware and software. The first entry
  is a reproducible tutorial on tiled matrix multiplication in Rust with
  cuda-oxide, measured on an NVIDIA Jetson AGX Thor, together with a JOSE
  submission package and teaching material.
